var _imgSrc="images";function initForm(){getCurrentUser();displayCurrentUser(_imgSrc);$("#header").html(buildHeaderContent(_imgSrc));$("#navigation").html(buildMenuHtml(_imgSrc));refreshRecent(_imgSrc);initMenu();var helpContent=buildAccordion(),$accord=$("#accordion");$accord.html(helpContent);$accord.accordion({autoHeight:false,collapsible:true,icons:false})}function buildAccordion(){var html=[];$.each(helpSections_Get(),function(index,section){var imgSrc=SVC_IMAGE_GET_THUMBNAIL+"?imageId="+section.ImageId+"&createThumbnail=false&maxSize=0";html.push('<h3><img src="'+imgSrc+'" class="hdrIcon"/><a href="#'+index+'">');html.push(section.Title+"</a></h3>");if(index===0){html.push('<div><label class="ui-widget">   Client UI Version: '+CLIENT_UI_VERSION+"</label>");html.push("<br/>");html.push('<label class="ui-widget">REST Service Version: '+service_GetVersion()+"</label></div>")}else html.push("<div>"+section.Content+"</div>")});return html.join("")}function submitBug(){var area=$("#bugArea").val(),criticality=$("#bugCriticality").val(),title=$("#bugTitle").val(),bugText=$("#memBugReport").val(),messageText=null,messageTitle=null;if(bug_Create(area,criticality,title,bugText)){messageText="Your bug has been submitted.<br/>Thanks for the notification.";messageTitle="Bug Submitted";$("#bugArea").val("-1");$("#bugCriticality").val("-1");$("#bugTitle").val("");$("#memBugReport").val("")}else{messageText="A bug while submitting your bug?  This isn't your day is it.<br/>The bug report did not submit.";messageTitle="Bug Submittal Failed"}$("#messageDialog").html(messageText);$("#messageDialog").dialog({width:350,height:"auto",modal:true,autoOpen:false,resizable:false,draggable:false,title:messageTitle,buttons:{Ok:function(){$(this).dialog("close")}}});$("#messageDialog").dialog("open")}function submitSuggestion(){var title=$("#suggestionTitle").val(),suggestion=$("#memSuggestion").val(),messageText=null,messageTitle=null;if(suggestion_Create(title,suggestion)){messageText="Your suggestion has been submitted.<br/>Thanks for the input.";messageTitle="Suggestion Submitted";$("#suggestionTitle").val("");$("#memSuggestion").val("")}else{messageText="An error occured while submitting your feedback.<br/>The suggestion did not submit.";messageTitle="Suggestion Submittal Failed"}$("#messageDialog").html(messageText);$("#messageDialog").dialog({width:350,height:"auto",modal:true,autoOpen:false,resizable:false,draggable:false,title:messageTitle,buttons:{Ok:function(){$(this).dialog("close")}}});$("#messageDialog").dialog("open")}